<p>Was asked to take a look at this.</p>
<p>For the sake of comparison, consider <a href="/scp-4057">SCP-4057</a>. It sets out to do a very similar thing to what you're talking about but it's a tad &quot;tighter&quot;, I guess would be the word. The meme is explained in the narrative, first of all, and it's tied into what happens when the non-anomalous person is contained.</p>
<p>What you've got here is an interesting setup — non-anomalous person in containment — but I'm not sensing a really cohesive story. Where'd this meme come from, why does it only affect the Foundation, why does it become this extreme, why is this person worthy of note, etc.</p>

